2.27,Title,,0,0,0,,The Case of the Kidnapped PirateDialogue: 1,0:02:47.52,0:02:52.27,Title,,0,0,0,,The Case of the Kidnapped PirateDialogue: 5,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Paulie!Dialogue: 5,0:01:52.71,0:01:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't get away this time!Dialogue: 5,0:01:55.21,0:01:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm asking you to wait just a bit longer!Dialogue: 5,0:01:57.80,0:01:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's that?Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.29,0:02:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Paulie.Dialogue: 5,0:02:00.47,0:02:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's running from debt collectors again.Dialogue: 5,0:02:02.51,0:02:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay back the money!Dialogue: 5,0:02:04.01,0:02:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I don't have any cash today.Dialogue: 5,0:02:07.39,0:02:10.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a load of crap!Dialogue: 5,0:02:10.52,0:02:13.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn, they won't let up!Dialogue: 5,0:02:13.11,0:02:15.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Perfect! Yagara bulls!Dialogue: 5,0:02:17.36,0:02:20.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rope Action!Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.41,0:02:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ahhh!  – He's a Galley-La shipwright!Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.87,0:02:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'd like to borrow  your yagara for a bit!Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Round Turn!Dialogue: 5,0:02:55.79,0:02:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn! He got away again!Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, everyone, take care!Dialogue: 5,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's run around again soon!Dialogue: 5,0:03:03.95,0:03:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 5,0:03:05.45,0:03:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously though! You came in the nick of time!Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.40,0:03:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief! He's one of your shipwrights, right?Dialogue: 5,0:03:17.88,0:03:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.48,0:03:21.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That money belongs to us!Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.26,0:03:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Money?Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.35,0:03:27.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see...Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.81,0:03:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...! Huh? Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.31,0:03:36.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here!Dialogue: 5,0:03:36.98,0:03:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That jerk! I'll bring him ba–Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.49,0:03:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got this.Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.66,0:03:47.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? A... A pigeon?Dialogue: 5,0:03:47.62,0:03:50.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!  Hey, hey, let me go!Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.94,0:03:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:53.08,0:03:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna run, man! I get it, okay?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go of my ear!Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.78,0:04:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And just when I lucked into all this money!Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this, Lucci!Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.93,0:04:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't pay back your debts  with other people's money, you ignoramus!Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I found this money!Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.18,0:04:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think that story will fly?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:14.10,0:04:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It just happened to be  on the yagara that I borrowed!Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're back.Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.29,0:04:22.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm happy for you, Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:04:22.87,0:04:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you've got no skin in the game!  It's our 200 million belly!Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.71,0:04:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! Why the hell weren't you  the first one to go get it back?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.19,0:04:34.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that pigeon said he'd go.Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.87,0:04:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sorry.Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.60,0:04:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should deal with our own idiot employees,Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.51,0:04:43.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,otherwise, it'd create  undue tension if you'd caught him.Dialogue: 5,0:04:43.90,0:04:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, consider yourselves lucky your money wasn't stolen by the Franky Family.Dialogue: 5,0:04:48.51,0:04:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm. That's true.Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true, that's true.Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.23,0:04:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So then, who were those  weird-looking guys from earlier?Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.07,0:05:02.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Franky Family:  a group of ship dismantlers.Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.40,0:05:07.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dismantlers? They seemed more like thugs than craftsmen.Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.37,0:05:11.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right. They're also bounty hunters on the side.Dialogue: 5,0:05:11.60,0:05:16.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They cause quite the stir every time they  discover pirates have entered the city.Dialogue: 5,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're a public nuisance.Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.83,0:05:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they take out the pirates who come to town, they also get their ship, see?Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.38,0:05:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They dismantle the ship  and sell the usable lumber.Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.93,0:05:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just the Franky Family business.Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.89,0:05:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What crawled up their butts?! Are they trying to dismantle all pirate crews?!Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.06,0:05:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, run afoul of them and you're as good as dust.Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they didn't look that strong.Dialogue: 5,0:05:40.35,0:05:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're just lackeys.Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.84,0:05:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think what you will of them, but never underestimate their boss, Franky.Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.45,0:05:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got him, Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:05:54.01,0:05:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Again! You're hurting my ear!Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good work, Lucci.Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.71,0:06:01.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're sorry this birdbrain caused you trouble.Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.42,0:06:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! It spoke again!Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.55,0:06:08.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, apologize to them, Paulie!Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.90,0:06:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That pigeon's doing all the talking!Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.50,0:06:14.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like he's speaking for the guy with the hat.Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.72,0:06:17.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, I'm so glad the money's back!Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.69,0:06:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, so the money belonged to you?Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.48,0:06:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I brought it back for you.Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.24,0:06:23.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.69,0:06:26.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A finder's fee of 10% is also good thanks.Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.69,0:06:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that, sir.Dialogue: 5,0:06:32.10,0:06:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy's gambling debt is so high,Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.18,0:06:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's turned greedy and mannerless.Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.08,0:06:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, but why are you talking?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.63,0:06:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cagey bastard!  Stop running your mouth, Lucci!Dialogue: 5,0:06:43.92,0:06:45.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've crossed the line!Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.21,0:06:48.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rope Action:Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:06:51.30,0:06:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bowline Knot!Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.43,0:06:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Discipline:Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.10,0:07:03.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Oh, no! He's serious!Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.89,0:07:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fly Fishing!Dialogue: 5,0:07:13.50,0:07:16.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-Is he okay?Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.01,0:07:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, this always happens.Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.80,0:07:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! L-L-Look at that!Dialogue: 5,0:07:23.67,0:07:27.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He absorbed the impact with just one arm!Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.20,0:07:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His fingers dug into the ground!Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.28,0:07:36.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck is up with his fingers?Dialogue: 5,0:07:36.35,0:07:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What sort of shipwrights  do they have working here?Dialogue: 5,0:07:42.29,0:07:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! You, with the goggles!Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, think about it carefully.Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.61,0:07:52.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only one who ever  mocked or provoked you was...Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that pigeon!Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.19,0:08:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine! But Lucci's the one who hit me!Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.25,0:08:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pigeon can't hit you himself,  so he had that guy do it!Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.63,0:08:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, pigeon!Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.38,0:08:14.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fight your own battles!Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say something!Dialogue: 5,0:08:21.70,0:08:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.77,0:08:25.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? You wanna fight?  Bring it on, you bastard!Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.89,0:08:27.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Paulie.Dialogue: 5,0:08:27.90,0:08:31.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, sorry for the fuss.Dialogue: 5,0:08:31.82,0:08:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Rob L... N-No, I mean, Hattori the pigeon.Dialogue: 5,0:08:35.18,0:08:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And this is Rob Lucci, one of the workers here. Nice to meet you!Dialogue: 5,0:08:40.24,0:08:44.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? He just about introduced himself as if he were the human!Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.67,0:08:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aha! Yeah, I know this trick!  That's ventriloquism, isn't it?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:48.13,0:08:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Seriously?! Then you really were the one mocking him!Dialogue: 5,0:08:51.31,0:08:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really, really good!  I didn't notice!Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.49,0:08:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop. Don't make a big deal of it.Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.00,0:09:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a freak who can't talk  to people normally.Dialogue: 5,0:09:04.81,0:09:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec! What's up with you, lady?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:08.02,0:09:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?Dialogue: 5,0:09:09.48,0:09:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Completely shameless!Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.01,0:09:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:09:13.38,0:09:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Showing off so much of your legs like this!Dialogue: 5,0:09:18.20,0:09:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a workplace for men!  What possessed you to dress like that?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.70,0:09:25.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Paulie.Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too, Kalifa!Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.00,0:09:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned by now  you can't wear such scandalous clothes?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:36.41,0:09:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?!  Wear pants! Long pants!Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.80,0:09:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– He's serious, isn't he?  – Long pants?Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.21,0:09:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a freak too!Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.81,0:09:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that was fun. Let's open the gate and head inside.Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.70,0:10:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe the size of this gate! And it's manually operated?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.89,0:10:08.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can those two freaks open it by themselves?Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.09,0:10:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's moving!Dialogue: 5,0:10:13.29,0:10:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, each dock has only  five shipwright foremen.Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.28,0:10:20.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strange as they are, their skills earned them their spots as Dock One foremen.Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.51,0:10:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku, the man from earlier,  is one of them.Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.81,0:10:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In this industry, what matters is how one plies their trade.Dialogue: 5,0:10:27.25,0:10:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're freaky, but so what?Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.50,0:10:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they are freaky.Dialogue: 5,0:10:30.75,0:10:32.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's starting to open!Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.57,0:10:36.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And keep hold of your money. There shouldn't be thieves here, but still.Dialogue: 5,0:10:37.90,0:10:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's partially my fault.  Sorry for the trouble.Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.10,0:10:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hey, Luffy!  – Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.66,0:10:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure you guard me good!Dialogue: 5,0:10:46.48,0:10:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it! Leave it to me!Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.49,0:10:49.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.29,0:10:49.96,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.96,0:10:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What you see here is Dock One, the core of Galley-La Company,Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.58,0:10:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where we handle our most challenging orders.Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.96,0:10:59.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, come inside.Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.15,0:11:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow!Dialogue: 5,0:11:03.22,0:11:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoooa!Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.40,0:11:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoooa! It's all huge!Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.49,0:11:22.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This shipyard's even more incredible  when seen up close!Dialogue: 5,0:11:22.04,0:11:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!  – True!Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.10,0:11:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? They're building a huge galleon!  Who's it for?Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're so many craftsmen.Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come! This way.Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.74,0:11:37.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:11:37.80,0:11:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! The boss is here!Dialogue: 5,0:11:40.67,0:11:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good morning!Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.68,0:11:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss! Could you take a look  at how the hull turned out?Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure! I'll come by later!Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice day today, Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:11:52.68,0:11:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, hi there. Everything going well?Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.14,0:11:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! They're going pretty well!Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.36,0:12:01.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Everyone likes Iceboss.Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.46,0:12:04.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed they do.  Skill means everything in this city.Dialogue: 5,0:12:05.23,0:12:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shipbuilding has always been  this island's main industry,Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.70,0:12:12.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and seven shipyards were  competing for contracts.Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.22,0:12:17.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He eventually charmed the shipwrights  with his genius craftsmanship.Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.54,0:12:22.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Five years ago, he managed to merge all seven companies, and the rest is history.Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.51,0:12:24.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the Galley-La Company.Dialogue: 5,0:12:25.40,0:12:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His passion and skill for shipbuilding hasn't waned,Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.60,0:12:31.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he's never lost  the respect of the shipwrights.Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.85,0:12:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And, because the craftsmen  take pride in their skills,Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.90,0:12:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they neither give in to pirates nor authority.Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.40,0:12:42.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's how things run here.Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.00,0:12:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.86,0:12:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, old guy. I heard you're a top-notch shipwright.Dialogue: 5,0:12:46.30,0:12:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanna be a pirate with me?Dialogue: 5,0:12:48.12,0:12:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanna run that by us again, jackass?!Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-How brazen!Dialogue: 5,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, y'know, he's always like this.Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.93,0:12:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that.Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.00,0:12:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, you guys don't have a single shipwright aboard your ship?Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.09,0:12:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.90,0:13:04.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We came to this island to get our ship fixed and find a new crew member.Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.68,0:13:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's true that we have a whole slew of shipwrights,Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.40,0:13:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I wonder if any fancy the life of a pirate.Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.47,0:13:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's anyone here who's willing  to sail with you, they're yours.Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.23,0:13:19.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?! You're pretty generous!  How about you, old guy?Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.19,0:13:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, I can't. I'm the mayor.Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.06,0:13:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blow it off!Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.67,0:13:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, is there a woman  named Nico Robin on your ship?Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.49,0:13:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is! She's really smart.Dialogue: 5,0:13:36.79,0:13:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Is something the matter with Robin?Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.26,0:13:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.72,0:13:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe just how amazing this is!Dialogue: 5,0:13:48.05,0:13:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep that steady! Don't rush! Go slowly!Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.35,0:13:56.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we could install a cannon like that,  the Merry would be more– Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.19,0:13:58.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! A demi-culverin!Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.44,0:14:04.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So cool! It's so long... and shiny!Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.40,0:14:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd give anything to fire  something like that just once.Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.36,0:14:08.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance.Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.61,0:14:13.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's made of copper.  That must be expensive!Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.60,0:14:16.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they'd let me try firing it.Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.08,0:14:20.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. We've now got 300 million belly.Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.45,0:14:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can afford to buy a few of those cannons!Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.30,0:14:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.78,0:14:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wasn't someone standing there?Dialogue: 5,0:14:46.78,0:14:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Kaku!Dialogue: 5,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Where have you been?  – An assessment.Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.39,0:14:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! You're the guy from earlier!  So you checked our ship?Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.49,0:14:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right you are.Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.50,0:14:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Iceburg-san, you're present.Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.08,0:15:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm all caught up. How did it go?Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.25,0:15:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In all honesty...Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.42,0:15:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Come on down!Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.28,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that true?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.28,0:15:28.90,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Lie to me, and you're done for!Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.00,0:15:33.57,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,A lie has no legs in my line of work.Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.21,0:15:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, where's Usopp?Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.61,0:15:54.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was just over there up until a moment ago.Dialogue: 5,0:15:56.51,0:16:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!  Don't these cases belong to you?Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.10,0:16:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Usopp was carrying these!Dialogue: 5,0:16:06.30,0:16:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're ours.Dialogue: 5,0:16:07.32,0:16:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.29,0:16:14.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Where did you go, Usopp,  leaving all our precious money unattended?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.74,0:16:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Money?Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.20,0:16:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Those bags hold 200 million belly.Dialogue: 5,0:16:19.62,0:16:21.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,200 million belly?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.66,0:16:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not possible. See ya!Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.58,0:16:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way.Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.70,0:16:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, how much will it cost?Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.55,0:16:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can pay as much as you like!  We've got tons of money!Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.47,0:16:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If possible, I'd like her to be stronger,  have more cannons, and be faster!Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.93,0:16:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you also stylize the outer hull  with some tasteful engravings?Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.89,0:16:48.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you renovate the interior as well?Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.27,0:16:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just hold your horses.Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.82,0:16:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys have truly been on one incredible lark after another, right?Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.80,0:16:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet we did! We flew into the sky and fell back down.Dialogue: 5,0:16:59.60,0:17:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We sailed up a mountain  and even got skewered.Dialogue: 5,0:17:01.90,0:17:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gone through quite a bit!Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, we'd like to have her fixed good!Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.39,0:17:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her scars from battle are too deep.Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.81,0:17:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it'll take awhile  to complete her repairs?Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.26,0:17:15.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.05,0:17:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you straight. Your ship...Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.90,0:17:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is beyond repair, even with our expertise.Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.79,0:17:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's the keel.Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.78,0:17:44.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's more or less kaput.Dialogue: 5,0:17:44.66,0:17:46.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way.Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.69,0:17:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we've been traveling  just fine up until today!Dialogue: 5,0:17:49.92,0:17:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's suppose that we  gave it the old college try.Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.38,0:17:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The probability that she reaches the next island is...Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.40,0:18:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,zero.Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.21,0:18:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Merry, are you really...Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.78,0:18:20.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,done sailing?Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.10,0:18:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, crap.Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.99,0:18:31.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sanji. I got a little lost in the books.Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to apologize.Dialogue: 5,0:18:34.50,0:18:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I coulda sworn the one with Robin-chan was you in human form.Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.49,0:18:44.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, who in the world was that masked man?Dialogue: 5,0:18:44.18,0:18:46.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stranger still, they suddenly disappeared.Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.80,0:18:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Robin's scent vanished there too.Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.19,0:18:55.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's probably nothing, but my stomach's in knots about this.Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.82,0:18:56.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.90,0:18:58.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you need me to give you a checkup?Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.80,0:19:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not sick!Dialogue: 5,0:19:01.05,0:19:04.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I feel like that guy Aokiji  said something about this.Dialogue: 5,0:19:05.20,0:19:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what did he say?Dialogue: 5,0:19:07.00,0:19:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He kept alluding to Robin-chan's past.Dialogue: 5,0:19:10.20,0:19:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He also mentioned we'd  someday regret taking her on.Dialogue: 5,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That rings a bell.Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.49,0:19:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how does this relate  to Robin's disappearance?Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.33,0:19:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know.Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.00,0:19:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're getting nowhere like this.  Let's go back to the Merry for now.Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.11,0:19:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's no problem, she'll be back soon.Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.79,0:19:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good point.Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.04,0:19:52.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't fix the Merry?! Why not?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.21,0:19:55.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you guys amazing shipwrights?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.38,0:20:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you need money, just look! We've more than enough!Dialogue: 5,0:20:00.29,0:20:02.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Money's not the issue.Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.59,0:20:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the money in the world can't  return your ship to its original state.Dialogue: 5,0:20:08.31,0:20:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm rather surprised that your crew made it  this far in a ship that's worse for the wear.Dialogue: 5,0:20:15.27,0:20:18.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!  What's wrong with Merry?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.69,0:20:21.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know what the keel is, you hussy?Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.82,0:20:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the bottom of the ship?Dialogue: 5,0:20:23.49,0:20:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. It's the most crucial piece of wood on the ship.Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.79,0:20:31.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It supports the ship from stem to stern.Dialogue: 5,0:20:31.04,0:20:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you build a ship,  you start off by placing the keel.Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.00,0:20:40.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then the stem, the stern, and the frame structure— that'd be the floors, futtocks, and deck beams—Dialogue: 5,0:20:40.80,0:20:45.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you carefully position each piece of lumber around the keel.Dialogue: 5,0:20:45.30,0:20:47.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shipbuilding in a nutshell.Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.49,0:20:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The keel is the very foundation— the very essence—of a ship's framework.Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.15,0:20:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once it's damaged beyond repair,  it can't just be replaced.Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.81,0:21:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, replacing the keel is essentially building a ship from scratch.Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.03,0:21:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, no one can fix her anymore.Dialogue: 5,0:21:04.09,0:21:08.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your ship is little more than scrap wood awaiting its fate.Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.03,0:21:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't say it like that!Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.87,0:21:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever. It's the truth.Dialogue: 5,0:21:16.35,0:21:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay then! You gotta build us a ship from scratch!Dialogue: 5,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Build the Going Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:21:22.89,0:21:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not possible either.Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.19,0:21:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.22,0:21:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can build a similar ship,Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.80,0:21:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but strictly speaking,  it wouldn't be the same as before.Dialogue: 5,0:21:32.29,0:21:36.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The reality is that no two ships can ever be exactly the same.Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.23,0:21:37.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meaning what?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.40,0:21:41.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do any two trees ever grow in exactly the same way?Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.69,0:21:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A seafaring vessel is built  almost entirely of wood,Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.49,0:21:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so the size and curves of the ship  are determined by the wood's shape.Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.04,0:21:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why an exact duplicate of the ship can't be built, even when using the same blueprint.Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.29,0:21:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we tried using a blueprint to build a copy of a ship,Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.50,0:22:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without a doubt, the crew who knew the old ship best would instantly feel the difference.Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.39,0:22:05.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That crew'd be you guys!Dialogue: 5,0:22:06.59,0:22:08.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, that...Dialogue: 5,0:22:08.47,0:22:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means we really can't sail  aboard the Going Merry ever again?Dialogue: 5,0:22:13.18,0:22:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got the gist of it.Dialogue: 5,0:22:15.21,0:22:17.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either sail her into a watery grave,Dialogue: 5,0:22:18.07,0:22:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or take her apart lickety split.Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.20,0:22:24.27,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,A caravel!Dialogue: 5,0:22:24.27,0:22:27.36,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Ooh! She's a great ship!Dialogue: 5,0:22:28.70,0:22:34.17,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,All right! All done! Our pirate ship,  the Going Merry, is finally ready!Dialogue: 5,0:22:37.40,0:22:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, your ship has reached her end.Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.29,0:22:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a good opportunity.Dialogue: 5,0:22:42.18,0:22:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to face facts and buy a new ship.Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.49,0:22:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got money, right? And I heard correctly that your ship's a caravel?Dialogue: 5,0:22:49.37,0:22:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, she's an older style of ship  and wouldn't handle the journey ahead anyway.Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.34,0:22:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. I don't intend to get a new ship.Dialogue: 5,0:22:56.80,0:22:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.30,0:23:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our...Dialogue: 5,0:23:00.27,0:23:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our ship is the Going Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:23:03.24,0:23:05.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If she's repaired, she'll sail!Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.69,0:23:09.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She'll be okay! Even today, she sailed with no problem!Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.32,0:23:12.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, outta nowhere,  you say she's done sailing?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:12.49,0:23:14.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would believe that?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:14.39,0:23:20.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only reason you'd tell us this is because you don't know how determined she is!Dialogue: 5,0:23:21.28,0:23:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you'd sail her 'til she sinks.Dialogue: 5,0:23:23.50,0:23:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good grief.Dialogue: 5,0:23:26.50,0:23:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a ship's captain?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:32.48,0:23:34.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This discussion is over.Dialogue: 5,0:23:34.38,0:23:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think it over and come back when you're ready to buy a new ship.Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.02,0:23:39.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you.Dialogue: 5,0:23:39.50,0:23:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you spent the 300 million here,  we'd build you a state-of-the-art ship.Dialogue: 5,0:23:43.28,0:23:45.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa!Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.07,0:23:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here. Please look this over.Dialogue: 5,0:23:47.80,0:23:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This catalog lists new and used models.Dialogue: 5,0:23:50.00,0:23:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See the pricing too.Dialogue: 5,0:23:51.84,0:23:53.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:23:54.32,0:23:57.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have a visitor at the gate.Dialogue: 5,0:23:57.08,0:24:00.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That World Government official  is here again, it seems.Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.40,0:24:01.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall I turn him away?Dialogue: 5,0:24:02.26,0:24:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, sure thing! Tell him I'm not here.Dialogue: 5,0:24:05.49,0:24:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you've got  a bad case of bed head, Lulu.Dialogue: 5,0:24:09.30,0:24:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drat! Pardon me!Dialogue: 5,0:24:12.13,0:24:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll ask him to leave.Dialogue: 5,0:24:14.00,0:24:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, would you?Dialogue: 5,0:24:15.61,0:24:18.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Iceburg-kun.Dialogue: 5,0:24:20.90,0:24:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're here after all.Dialogue: 5,0:24:22.85,0:24:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, hide!  They're government officials!Dialogue: 5,0:24:26.00,0:24:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? O-Okay.Dialogue: 5,0:24:32.83,0:24:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, hello there, Corgi.  I'm not here today.Dialogue: 5,0:24:36.80,0:24:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are!Dialogue: 5,0:24:38.28,0:24:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, I came all this way by sea train.Dialogue: 5,0:24:41.85,0:24:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't avoid me.Dialogue: 5,0:24:43.99,0:24:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:24:51.80,0:24:55.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do I smell, but the scent of pirates?Dialogue: 5,0:24:55.39,0:24:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.  But I'm only here to chat.Dialogue: 5,0:24:58.43,0:25:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate you! Go home!Dialogue: 5,0:25:01.10,0:25:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acting like a child?Dialogue: 5,0:25:02.27,0:25:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a fully grown man.Dialogue: 5,0:25:06.90,0:25:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, then stop stalling.Dialogue: 5,0:25:09.08,0:25:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really going to like what I have to say. Please just hear me out.Dialogue: 5,0:25:15.53,0:25:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go somewhere private.Dialogue: 5,0:25:20.29,0:25:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They keep coming back. How persistent.Dialogue: 5,0:25:23.89,0:25:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What could they want with Iceburg-san ?Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.19,0:25:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with us.  It must be something to do with power.Dialogue: 5,0:25:30.26,0:25:31.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall I beat them silly?Dialogue: 5,0:25:31.90,0:25:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perish the thought.  They're from the World Government.Dialogue: 5,0:25:39.01,0:25:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hmm?  – What? What's wrong?Dialogue: 5,0:25:42.60,0:25:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, I noticed something about the cases  when we were hiding.Dialogue: 5,0:25:48.40,0:25:50.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're pretty light.Dialogue: 5,0:25:50.10,0:25:52.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...? Why?Dialogue: 5,0:25:52.85,0:25:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't joke like that. They couldn't be light with all that money in them.Dialogue: 5,0:26:03.66,0:26:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who was that just now?!Dialogue: 5,0:26:08.00,0:26:10.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiots! What's the big fuss?!Dialogue: 5,0:26:11.05,0:26:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, woman! Sitting like that lets me see...!Dialogue: 5,0:26:15.28,0:26:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... There's...Dialogue: 5,0:26:20.20,0:26:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 5,0:26:24.85,0:26:26.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our 200 million belly!Dialogue: 5,0:26:26.85,0:26:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gone! It's really gone!Dialogue: 5,0:26:28.81,0:26:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that I see them,  these aren't even our briefcases!Dialogue: 5,0:26:33.23,0:26:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-What're we gonna do?!Dialogue: 5,0:26:34.37,0:26:37.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! What's with the shouting?Dialogue: 5,0:26:37.32,0:26:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our money is... gone.Dialogue: 5,0:26:40.40,0:26:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's... totally... gone.Dialogue: 5,0:26:43.29,0:26:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!  – Paulie! You again?Dialogue: 5,0:26:45.64,0:26:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me!Dialogue: 5,0:26:46.50,0:26:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Truthfully? – I ain't lyin'!Dialogue: 5,0:26:49.10,0:26:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Is that really true?!  – They're so loud. At any rate, Kaku,Dialogue: 5,0:26:52.71,0:26:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,didn't I see you with the Franky Family earlier?Dialogue: 5,0:26:55.79,0:26:57.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm? How do you mean?Dialogue: 5,0:26:57.70,0:27:00.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've not clapped eyes on the Franky Family all day.Dialogue: 5,0:27:00.51,0:27:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sure is strange. I swear I saw your long nose among them.Dialogue: 5,0:27:05.80,0:27:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, you guys!Dialogue: 5,0:27:07.48,0:27:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:27:09.39,0:27:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was with the Franky Family?!Dialogue: 5,0:27:11.48,0:27:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was with them, or rather,  he was carried away by them.Dialogue: 5,0:27:15.85,0:27:17.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They kidnapped him!Dialogue: 5,0:27:17.57,0:27:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! We need to find him quickly!Dialogue: 5,0:27:19.40,0:27:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 5,0:27:20.53,0:27:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait! Where're you gonna look, Luffy?!Dialogue: 5,0:27:26.62,0:27:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just wait, Usopp! Money!Dialogue: 5,0:27:33.20,0:27:34.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Urgh!Dialogue: 5,0:27:34.41,0:27:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the Franky Family's hideout?Dialogue: 5,0:27:37.01,0:27:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not really a hideout.  The place is their workshop,Dialogue: 5,0:27:41.18,0:27:44.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,located near where your ship is anchored.Dialogue: 5,0:27:44.09,0:27:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just follow the coast northwest from the rocky cape.Dialogue: 5,0:27:47.10,0:27:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's called the Franky House.Dialogue: 5,0:27:52.71,0:27:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:27:55.59,0:27:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:27:58.47,0:28:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What gives? As if he could just  run off and find Usopp by himself!Dialogue: 5,0:28:03.84,0:28:06.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finding Luffy will have to wait.Dialogue: 5,0:28:06.01,0:28:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,  I'll get the money back to the ship.Dialogue: 5,0:28:09.36,0:28:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bringing 100 million with me while asking for 200 million...Dialogue: 5,0:28:12.13,0:28:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is just begging them to take the rest.Dialogue: 5,0:28:15.35,0:28:19.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, yagara-chan, please take the quickest route back to the bull shop!Dialogue: 5,0:28:25.60,0:28:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, me, and the others  will need to teach them a lesson!Dialogue: 5,0:28:28.56,0:28:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Family! Stealing from pirates was a bad decision!Dialogue: 5,0:28:39.52,0:28:43.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome to level one,  the backstreet shopping district.Dialogue: 5,0:28:43.81,0:28:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care and have a good day!Dialogue: 5,0:28:50.04,0:28:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, yagara-chan !Dialogue: 5,0:28:54.60,0:28:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!Dialogue: 5,0:28:56.58,0:28:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out, lady!Dialogue: 5,0:28:58.75,0:29:00.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry!Dialogue: 5,0:29:01.71,0:29:05.97,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, tell me you somehow got away.Dialogue: 5,0:29:19.11,0:29:20.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.Dialogue: 5,0:29:20.49,0:29:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is he?Dialogue: 5,0:29:21.79,0:29:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Does anyone know who this guy is?!Dialogue: 5,0:29:24.07,0:29:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A crowd of people...Dialogue: 5,0:29:25.80,0:29:28.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, yagara-chan ! Stop! Stop!Dialogue: 5,0:29:34.70,0:29:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:29:39.00,0:29:40.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Wake up!Dialogue: 5,0:29:40.38,0:29:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 5,0:29:42.84,0:29:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon!Dialogue: 5,0:29:43.92,0:29:47.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Usopp! Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:29:47.00,0:29:49.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So hey, you guys wouldn't happen to be pirates?Dialogue: 5,0:29:49.83,0:29:52.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't just stand there gawking!Dialogue: 5,0:29:54.30,0:29:58.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Was it the Franky Family  who did this to you? Was it them?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:01.49,0:30:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I was too weak.Dialogue: 5,0:30:06.61,0:30:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that money...Dialogue: 5,0:30:08.30,0:30:10.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they stole it all.Dialogue: 5,0:30:12.50,0:30:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami...Dialogue: 5,0:30:14.01,0:30:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?Dialogue: 5,0:30:16.41,0:30:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The crew... I can't face them.Dialogue: 5,0:30:24.60,0:30:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And... we were so close to having the Merry repaired.Dialogue: 5,0:30:31.99,0:30:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel... so ashamed.Dialogue: 5,0:30:37.71,0:30:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 5,0:30:41.05,0:30:43.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I get it.Dialogue: 5,0:30:43.90,0:30:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the money.  You can count on us to get it back.Dialogue: 5,0:30:48.32,0:30:53.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He's hurt pretty bad.  I probably shouldn't move him.Dialogue: 5,0:30:53.70,0:30:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, stay here for a bit.Dialogue: 5,0:30:56.50,0:31:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll hurry back to the ship and bring back help.Dialogue: 5,0:31:00.30,0:31:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll bring Chopper too, so that he can treat you!Dialogue: 5,0:31:02.88,0:31:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't worry about the money!Dialogue: 5,0:31:05.39,0:31:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard their hideout is just up ahead.Dialogue: 5,0:31:08.37,0:31:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll crush them and put an end to this!Dialogue: 5,0:31:12.05,0:31:16.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't a show, you mouth breathers!Dialogue: 5,0:31:16.90,0:31:19.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine, Usopp. Just stay put, okay?Dialogue: 5,0:31:20.40,0:31:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!Dialogue: 5,0:31:26.94,0:31:30.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get the lead out, yagara-chan !Dialogue: 5,0:31:32.99,0:31:35.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! A runaway bull!Dialogue: 5,0:31:34.89,0:31:35.58,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:31:37.62,0:31:42.29,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,And... we were so close to having the Merry repaired.Dialogue: 5,0:31:44.04,0:31:48.71,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,All the money in the world can't  return your ship to its original state.Dialogue: 5,0:31:49.80,0:31:53.47,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Whether we decide to buy a new ship...Dialogue: 5,0:31:53.47,0:31:57.39,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,or find someone who's willing  to fix and improve the Merry,Dialogue: 5,0:31:57.39,0:32:01.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,we've got to spend the entire 300 million to upgrade or get a new ship.Dialogue: 5,0:32:01.89,0:32:04.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The seas will only get rougher from here.Dialogue: 5,0:32:05.34,0:32:07.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We definitely need that money.Dialogue: 5,0:32:07.99,0:32:09.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to get it back!Dialogue: 5,0:32:12.70,0:32:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that true?!Dialogue: 5,0:32:14.28,0:32:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least that's what that shipwright said.Dialogue: 5,0:32:19.29,0:32:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ship...Dialogue: 5,0:32:20.58,0:32:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...can no longer be fixed?  Even if we have the money?!Dialogue: 5,0:32:23.50,0:32:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, what'll happen to Merry?!Dialogue: 5,0:32:26.46,0:32:27.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me.Dialogue: 5,0:32:27.91,0:32:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end, it all depends on how Luffy  and the other two react to the assessment.Dialogue: 5,0:32:33.60,0:32:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those three at the shipyard  will probably come up with a solution.Dialogue: 5,0:32:37.60,0:32:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't buy it. It seems really sudden.Dialogue: 5,0:32:40.89,0:32:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at the ship!  She's the same old Merry.Dialogue: 5,0:32:44.10,0:32:48.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From the East Blue to here, we were with Merry the whole way!Dialogue: 5,0:32:48.65,0:32:51.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that's exactly the reason.Dialogue: 5,0:32:51.49,0:32:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Humans endure hardship and become more resilient;Dialogue: 5,0:32:55.05,0:32:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ships are different.Dialogue: 5,0:32:56.70,0:32:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They accumulate stress and damage.Dialogue: 5,0:33:03.85,0:33:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to swallow.Dialogue: 5,0:33:05.54,0:33:09.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, how's Usopp gonna react  when he hears this?Dialogue: 5,0:33:09.10,0:33:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, I love the Going Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:33:11.61,0:33:16.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We all do. But like that guy said,  her battle scars are too deep.Dialogue: 5,0:33:18.75,0:33:21.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's the Going Merry,  but then there's Robin-chan.Dialogue: 5,0:33:22.43,0:33:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a depressing afternoon.Dialogue: 5,0:33:26.11,0:33:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!Dialogue: 5,0:33:30.25,0:33:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Nami's come back!Dialogue: 5,0:33:32.36,0:33:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Looks like she's alone.Dialogue: 5,0:33:35.10,0:33:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to Luffy and Usopp?Dialogue: 5,0:33:37.81,0:33:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san ! Did something happen?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:45.75,0:33:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yow! Yow, yow! Did you say 200 million?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:49.69,0:33:51.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, 200 million!Dialogue: 5,0:33:51.59,0:33:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatcha think, Bro?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:54.51,0:33:57.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing! You guys are amazing!Dialogue: 5,0:33:57.89,0:34:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With this much cash, we can finally  get the thing we've always wanted!Dialogue: 5,0:34:03.39,0:34:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We did it, didn't we, Bro?Dialogue: 5,0:34:05.49,0:34:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After three long years! You'd always say, "Once I get the money..."Dialogue: 5,0:34:09.13,0:34:11.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– It took so long.  – Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:34:11.02,0:34:15.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Each time we got a chunk of money,  we'd pin our hopes on yagara races...Dialogue: 5,0:34:15.39,0:34:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and end up broke!Dialogue: 5,0:34:16.90,0:34:20.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Each time we captured a criminal  with a bounty, we'd party it up...Dialogue: 5,0:34:20.60,0:34:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and end up broke!Dialogue: 5,0:34:22.16,0:34:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We couldn't quite save up  the 200-million-belly business expense!Dialogue: 5,0:34:27.21,0:34:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we finally got it all!Dialogue: 5,0:34:29.13,0:34:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! You guys pulled through big time!Dialogue: 5,0:34:33.84,0:34:38.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, it ain't much,  but here's five million belly.Dialogue: 5,0:34:38.51,0:34:42.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to show you my appreciation,  so eat, drink, and be merry!Dialogue: 5,0:34:46.30,0:34:48.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's our Bro!Dialogue: 5,0:34:48.01,0:34:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's party time!Dialogue: 5,0:34:57.01,0:34:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell?!Dialogue: 5,0:34:59.80,0:35:00.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:35:01.20,0:35:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, dammit!Dialogue: 5,0:35:02.70,0:35:07.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who're you?! You wanna dance with the Franky Family?!Dialogue: 5,0:35:13.09,0:35:16.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! You're that string bean from earlier!Dialogue: 5,0:35:16.61,0:35:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell you still standin'?!Dialogue: 5,0:35:22.30,0:35:24.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me back the money!Dialogue: 5,0:35:24.01,0:35:30.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Give me back the money"? Does that mean you're one of Straw Hat's goons?Dialogue: 5,0:35:31.31,0:35:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right, Bro!Dialogue: 5,0:35:33.56,0:35:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since he's with Straw Hat Luffy,  we expected him to be a really tough pirate,Dialogue: 5,0:35:39.01,0:35:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...but it turns out he's just a weak punk!Dialogue: 5,0:35:41.92,0:35:44.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As if you'd understand anything!Dialogue: 5,0:35:45.62,0:35:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa there!Dialogue: 5,0:35:51.61,0:35:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he for real?!Dialogue: 5,0:35:53.04,0:35:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll admit you've got guts to come  to get the money back all by yourself,Dialogue: 5,0:35:56.81,0:35:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I can't let you have it.Dialogue: 5,0:36:02.91,0:36:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it back!Dialogue: 5,0:36:04.89,0:36:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to... have our ship repaired.Dialogue: 5,0:36:14.48,0:36:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We desperately need that money!Dialogue: 5,0:36:21.49,0:36:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With that money, we can finally...Dialogue: 5,0:36:25.08,0:36:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can finally mend  the Going Merry's wounds!Dialogue: 5,0:36:30.62,0:36:35.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This money... I won't let you assholes take it!Dialogue: 5,0:36:41.68,0:36:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's got you all worked up?Dialogue: 5,0:36:44.50,0:36:48.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see you really love your ship, am I right?Dialogue: 5,0:36:48.19,0:36:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad! Whatever happens to your ship,Dialogue: 5,0:36:52.64,0:36:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this money belongs to us now.Dialogue: 5,0:36:58.52,0:37:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, no one considers stealing from pirates a crime.Dialogue: 5,0:37:04.09,0:37:07.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me guess! It's dirty money you stole, right?Dialogue: 5,0:37:09.00,0:37:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, just let us keep it.Dialogue: 5,0:37:13.21,0:37:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You could always beg the Navy for help.Dialogue: 5,0:37:16.67,0:37:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you'll probably be the ones arrested.Dialogue: 5,0:37:20.81,0:37:23.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that Straw Hat Luffy...Dialogue: 5,0:37:23.61,0:37:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has such a useless underling  who can't even guard his money.Dialogue: 5,0:37:37.10,0:37:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, go ahead and show him a good time.Dialogue: 5,0:37:42.57,0:37:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm gonna take this money out for a little shopping!Dialogue: 5,0:37:48.06,0:37:49.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!Dialogue: 5,0:37:49.53,0:37:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!Dialogue: 5,0:37:50.49,0:37:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lethal Exploding Star!Dialogue: 5,0:38:00.75,0:38:05.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember this, long-nosed boy.  My name is Franky.Dialogue: 5,0:38:05.72,0:38:11.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you want to leave this town alive,  you'd be wise not to cross me.Dialogue: 5,0:38:14.60,0:38:18.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What... What're you doing?! Let go of me!Dialogue: 5,0:38:22.51,0:38:26.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puny weapons like this won't work on us!Dialogue: 5,0:38:26.95,0:38:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya, long-nose.Dialogue: 5,0:38:29.28,0:38:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the 200 million belly.Dialogue: 5,0:38:32.79,0:38:36.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Give it back... to me!Dialogue: 5,0:38:36.10,0:38:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it back!Dialogue: 5,0:38:38.10,0:38:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it baaack!Dialogue: 5,0:38:49.29,0:38:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it... back.Dialogue: 5,0:38:50.97,0:38:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it... baaack!Dialogue: 5,0:39:05.44,0:39:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give... it... back!Dialogue: 5,0:39:10.87,0:39:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it baaaaaack!Dialogue: 5,0:39:24.73,0:39:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just have to hold out until Robin comes back.Dialogue: 5,0:39:30.43,0:39:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd just get in the way if I marched in with the others.Dialogue: 5,0:39:34.51,0:39:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm scared.Dialogue: 5,0:39:37.59,0:39:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I'll do anything to protect this ship and the 100 million belly.Dialogue: 5,0:39:42.10,0:39:45.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest is in your hands... you guys!Dialogue: 5,0:39:47.04,0:39:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop. Stop!Dialogue: 5,0:39:52.71,0:39:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I remember right, this should be  the place Nami-san was talking about.Dialogue: 5,0:39:59.69,0:40:02.38,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Look here. That's the backstreet shopping district.Dialogue: 5,0:40:02.38,0:40:07.60,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,You go up this canal... and here!  Usopp is right here.Dialogue: 5,0:40:07.60,0:40:08.93,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 5,0:40:08.93,0:40:13.20,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,So, Nami-san, where can we find these demolishers, the Franky Family?Dialogue: 5,0:40:14.60,0:40:16.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:40:16.00,0:40:17.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp isn't here?Dialogue: 5,0:40:17.21,0:40:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Maybe you screwed up the directions.Dialogue: 5,0:40:19.80,0:40:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking, swordsmoron!Dialogue: 5,0:40:21.77,0:40:23.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:40:23.40,0:40:26.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What'd you say?!  – Oh!Dialogue: 5,0:40:29.50,0:40:31.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! It's blood!Dialogue: 5,0:40:31.28,0:40:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That dumbass!  He shouldn't have moved!Dialogue: 5,0:40:34.82,0:40:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have, right?Dialogue: 5,0:40:37.63,0:40:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:40:42.08,0:40:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:40:54.30,0:40:55.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!Dialogue: 5,0:40:55.56,0:40:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy?!Dialogue: 5,0:41:03.82,0:41:07.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!  Where'd you come falling from?Dialogue: 5,0:41:08.85,0:41:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The shipyard...Dialogue: 5,0:41:10.20,0:41:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was copying that shipwright,  jumping around to look for Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:41:14.28,0:41:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?Dialogue: 5,0:41:15.45,0:41:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:41:16.82,0:41:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right, guys!  We've got a problem!Dialogue: 5,0:41:19.56,0:41:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp got taken, along with the money.Dialogue: 5,0:41:22.31,0:41:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we know.Dialogue: 5,0:41:23.93,0:41:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on. We're headed to their hideout.Dialogue: 5,0:41:27.96,0:41:30.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They beat up Usopp and took the money.Dialogue: 5,0:41:30.70,0:41:31.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:41:33.60,0:41:35.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe he blamed himself...Dialogue: 5,0:41:35.53,0:41:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and left all on his own  to confront the Franky Family.Dialogue: 5,0:42:02.41,0:42:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he breathing, Chopper?Dialogue: 5,0:42:04.89,0:42:09.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's fallen unconscious;  he's not dead yet.Dialogue: 5,0:42:09.09,0:42:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be okay. I can save him.Dialogue: 5,0:42:16.49,0:42:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just rest there a moment... Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:42:44.31,0:42:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go demolish that stupid house!Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:11.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,Paulie Rigging and Mast Foreman Dock One Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 1,0:03:05.54,0:03:11.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,Paulie Rigging and Mast Foreman Dock One Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:04:04.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,Rob Lucci Sawyer and Treenail Foreman Dock One Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 1,0:03:58.63,0:04:04.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,Rob Lucci Sawyer and Treenail Foreman Dock One Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Hattori Lucci's PigeonDialogue: 1,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Hattori Lucci's PigeonDialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:24:01.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,Peepley Lulu Pitch, Blacksmithing, and  Block-And-Tackle Foreman Dock One Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 1,0:23:57.16,0:24:01.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,Peepley Lulu Pitch, Blacksmithing, and  Block-And-Tackle Foreman Dock One Galley-La CompanyDialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:45.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,Corgi World Government OfficialDialogue: 1,0:24:38.37,0:24:45.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,Corgi World Government OfficialDialogue: 0,0:33:42.87,0:33:45.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,Water Seven Outskirts Northeast CoastDialogue: 1,0:33:42.87,0:33:45.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,Water Seven Outskirts Northeast CoastDialogue: 0,0:33:42.87,0:33:45.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,DismantlersDialogue: 1,0:33:42.87,0:33:45.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,DismantlersDialogue: 0,0:33:45.83,0:33:51.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Franky HouseDialogue: 1,0:33:45.83,0:33:51.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Franky HouseDialogue: 0,0:42:55.01,0:43:01.76,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: PhosCity  Quality Control: Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack Zenef  Soundtracking: Halee  Graphics: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:08.05,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.59,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand, we convey our powerDialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.68,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come trueDialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Combining our strengths, we'll crest these surging seasDialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.29,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,1,,Hurry toward the thrill of danger— Let the adventure begin!Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:47.13,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to set sail; raise the anchorDialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:55.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Off to the seas of adventure, through rainbow-colored windsDialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:58.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Our journey's fraught with injuryDialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:02.27,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,But what we cherish most is right at our sideDialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.35,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And if you get into a jamDialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,I'll always be there to protect youDialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:16.82,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:20.33,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Shoulder to shoulder, we face all coming stormsDialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:24.20,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And look to the future for the light of hopeDialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:27.92,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,If we gather up the pieces of our dreamsDialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:31.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,They'll make a chart leading to tomorrowDialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.72,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,We come together under the same Jolly RogerDialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:40.45,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come true; together, we are...Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -9 4 l -8 -21 l -6 4 l 4 -5 l -5 5 l 19 7 l -5 8 l 5 18 l -6 9 l -7 33 l -9 9 l -19 18 l -10 7 l -34 6 l -10 5 l -20 -6Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -9 4 l -8 -21 l -6 4 l 4 -5 l -5 5 l 19 7 l -5 8 l 5 18 l -6 9 l -7 33 l -9 9 l -19 18 l -10 7 l -34 6 l -10 5 l -20 -6Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m 1 -5 l 4 -62 l 6 -5 l 30 -25 l 8 -3 l 69 -1 l 8 2 l 30 26 l 6 4 l 3 62 l 1 4 l -24 26 l -2 2 l -62 -1 l -2 -3 l -24 -25Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m 1 -5 l 4 -62 l 6 -5 l 30 -25 l 8 -3 l 69 -1 l 8 2 l 30 26 l 6 4 l 3 62 l 1 4 l -24 26 l -2 2 l -62 -1 l -2 -3 l -24 -25Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m 1 -5 l 4 -62 l 6 -5 l 30 -25 l 8 -3 l 69 -1 l 8 2 l 30 26 l 6 4 l 3 62 l 1 4 l -24 26 l -2 2 l -62 -1 l -2 -3 l -24 -25Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -12 4 l -12 -18 l -10 4 l -1 -5 l -9 5 l 9 5 l -9 7 l -2 14 l -10 8 l -10 27 l -12 8 l -21 16 l -13 6 l -35 5 l -13 5 l -20 -4Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:04.97,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -12 4 l -12 -18 l -10 4 l -1 -5 l -9 5 l 9 5 l -9 7 l -2 14 l -10 8 l -10 27 l -12 8 l -2